Original UFLinux desktop artwork
==============================

The original UFLinux desktop configuration selected Papirus icons and
/usr/share/backgrounds/gnome/Dark_Ivy.jpg. Reference:
https://github.com/UFlinux-project/main/blob/067f3069b20f78995920d30795d48d36c96fcdf7/config/includes.chroot_before_packages/etc/dconf/db/local.d/00_uflinux_defaults

Papirus is supplied by Alpine's signed papirus-icon-theme package. Its upstream
source, copyright and GPL-3.0-only license are maintained by that package.
https://github.com/PapirusDevelopmentTeam/papirus-icon-theme

The UFLinux leaf logo is copied without alteration from:
https://github.com/UFlinux-project/uf-calamares-settings/blob/53217a0b7edc494658a1dfcfee649365a19d0c79/etc/calamares/branding/uflinux/uflinuxlogo-spaces.svg
That repository distributes it under GPL-3.0. A copy is in GPL-3.0 alongside this
notice. The same unchanged logo is used for the Settings application icon.

Wallpaper images are copied without alteration from gnome-backgrounds 3.38.0:
https://download.gnome.org/sources/gnome-backgrounds/3.38/gnome-backgrounds-3.38.0.tar.xz
Dark_Ivy.jpg: Copyright 2012 Garrett LeSage, CC BY-SA 3.0.
Endless-shapes, Symbolics-1 and Symbolics-2: Copyright 2011-2020 Jakub Steiner,
CC BY-SA 3.0.
ColdWarm (invisiblepower) and Road (Joshua Welch): CC0.

The exact upstream attribution and license notices are retained as
backgrounds-AUTHORS and backgrounds-COPYING_CCBYSA3 alongside this file.
CC BY-SA 3.0: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/
CC0: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
These image licenses are separate from UFLinux's GPL-3.0-only program code.
